# Half-Life (valve/sprites) sprites that can be particles: the only ones the Dockerfile copies from the optional
# valve_sprites build context (Valve content: local test images only, see README.md). One file name per line,
# matched case-insensitively against the top of valve/sprites; # starts a comment.
#
# Left out on purpose: HUD and weapon-menu sheets (1280/, 2560/, 320*, 640*, 1280*, 2560*, hud*.txt sprites),
# crosshairs, logos (logo, small_logo, 320_logo, 640_logo), scoreboard / spectator icons (iflagblue, iflagred,
# iplayer*, iunknown), voiceicon, camera, arrow1, cnt1, tile, shellchrome, xffloor, bm1, agrunt1 (a picture of
# an alien grunt), and the orientation test
# sprites (oriented, vp_parallel, vp_parallel_oriented).

